              "type": "list",
              "items": [
                "Superficial Lymph Node Biopsy"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "Common risks"
            },
            {
              "type": "list",
              "items": [
                "Infection.",
                "Bleeding.",
                "Injury to nearby structures.",
                "Need for resampling."
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "Procedure-specific risks"
            },
            {
              "type": "list",
              "items": [
                "Neck hematoma with airway compromise if cervical target."
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "Consent discussion"
